<title>USA: TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Rhode Island 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$255,000 Hall of Fame Championships grass court tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>8-Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat 2-Mark Woodforde</p>
<p>(Australia) 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>3-Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat David Wheaton (U.S.) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
